i'm delighted to speak at such a  wonderful celebration of the teaching  profession  as unesco special envoy for peace and  reconciliation  i believe that education is on the front  line of making peace happen  between and within communities in this  respect  teachers always bring more the knowledge  and skills they open the minds and  hearts of our children  they create an awareness that the future  can always be a better place  and they do this every day most of this  work goes unnoticed because  teachers puts their students in the  spotlight  for me the global teacher prize is an  inspirational idea because it turns that  spotlight  and shines it on the unsung heroes who  teach in the classrooms  all around the world teachers like our  top 10 finalists here tonight  this year during the pandemic we have  seen the biggest disruption  to education in history and yet we have  seen teachers go above and beyond to  keep the world's children  learning today we will honor  one very special teacher i'm delighted  to announce that the global teacher  prize  covet hero award goes to jamie frost  from the united kingdom  jamie your internationally acclaimed  website for math tuition  dr frost mass has had over 7 million  resource downloads and is making  fun for children all over the world  especially during the pandemic  your creativity and dedication have  illuminated millions of minds for free  thank you jamie thank you to all the  world's teachers
 

